  "section": "3.350",
  "rulesText": "This section presents the Wizard spell list. The spells are organized by spell level and then alphabetized, and each spell's school of magic is listed. In the Special column, C means the spell requires Concentration, R means it's a Ritual, and M means it requires a specific Material component.\n\nCantrips (Level 0 Wizard Spells)\n\nLevel I Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 2 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 3 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 4 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 5 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 6 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 7 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 8 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 9 Wizard Spells",
